<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">The Indian Road Transport Congress (IRTC) mandates that all commercial freight be backed by an IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt (LR) or Bilty.</p>
