    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">80-GSM Heavy-Duty Air-Bubble Wrap:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Protects delicate items from scratches and dings during transit. Air-bubble wrap is a popular choice due to its air-cushioning effect and lightweight nature.</p>
